   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the environmental conservation law, in relation to authorizing hunting big game by rifle in the county of Orleans",
    "basePrintNo": "S4825",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4825-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §11-0907, En Con L",
    "lawSection": "Environmental Conservation Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S4825\n\n TITLE OF BILL :  An act to amend the environmental conservation law,\nin relation to authorizing hunting big game by rifle in the county of\nOrleans\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nThis legislation would allow for big game hunting in Orleans County.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nSection 1 amends environmental conservation law to add Orleans County\nto the list of Counties that are authorized to have big game season\nfrom November 15 through December 7th.\n\nSection 2 makes commensurate changes in law to allow for Orleans\nCounty to have big game hunting.\n\nSection 3 is the effective date.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThis legislation which is at the request of Orleans County would allow\nfor the hunting of big game for the period of time between November\n15th and December 7th. Currently many other Counties have this\nallowance under law and Orleans County wishes to be placed on the same\ntiered playing field for their local sportsmen.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nNew Bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
    "multiSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
